From 67712f9df75d5a8c368858324de0993386347258 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: patch <a@b.c>
Date: Fri, 2 Oct 2026 03:22:15 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Remove GZDoomEditing plugin

Doom 64 does not use the GZDoom visual mode plugin. Doom64.cfg uses the
BuilderModes visual mode, and no other project references this plugin.

- Delete Source/Plugins/GZDoomEditing
- Remove the project and its build configurations from Builder.sln
- Remove GZDoomEditing obj ignore entries from .gitignore
